              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ergasiis Ruut Moʼaabittiin, \"Inni, 'Hamma isaan midhaan koo hunda walitti qabanii fixanitti iyyuu hojjettoota koo wajjin turi' naan jedheera\" jetteen.",
          "type": "text",
